=== "Python"

```python title="binary_tree.py"
    # 初始化二叉树
    # 初始化节点
    n1 = TreeNode(val=1)
    n2 = TreeNode(val=2)
    n3 = TreeNode(val=3)
    n4 = TreeNode(val=4)
    n5 = TreeNode(val=5)
    # 构建节点之间的引用（指针）
