=== "Rust"

```rust title="binary_tree.rs"
    let p = TreeNode::new(0);
    // 在 n1 -> n2 中间插入节点 P
    n1.borrow_mut().left = Some(p.clone());
    p.borrow_mut().left = Some(n2.clone());
    // 删除节点 p
    n1.borrow_mut().left = Some(n2);
    ```

